WEBVTT

00:02:29.401 --> 00:02:33.374
You're not earning the sort of eulogy you want,

00:02:33.374 --> 00:02:34.934
you hope someone will give to you.

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:36.660
You don't have the 
depth of conviction.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.197
You don't have an emotional sonorousness.

00:02:39.197 --> 00:02:40.966
You don't have 
commitment to tasks

00:02:40.966 --> 00:02:44.180
that would take more than a lifetime to commit.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.627
I was reminded of a common
response through history

00:02:47.627 --> 00:02:50.389
of how you build a solid Adam II,

00:02:50.389 --> 00:02:52.399
how you build a depth of character.

00:02:52.399 --> 00:02:55.124
Through history, people 
have gone back

00:02:55.124 --> 00:02:57.010
into their own pasts,

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.260
sometimes to a precious 
time in their life,

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.719
to their childhood,